with ELEVEN removed verbs (plus 5 historical aliases = 16 parametrized rows). The headline count does not match the body's count, which could mislead an implementer about how many routes to delete.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f01ea34482fdca93e","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Title vs Context / AC1","norm_id":"n77cb88f7a5da0b20","priority":0.2263,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An implementer counting from the title deletes/expects twelve routes but the registry work enumerates eleven, producing an off-by-one in route deletion or test parametrization."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8571,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Re-derive the removed-verb retarget inventory from the symbol graph (find_referencing_symbols on each deleted handler, plus a scan of argv-position and helper-wrapped verb invocations such as tests/interfaces/adapters.py `tag()` and `main([\"format\", ...])`) rather than from the two string-literal greps named in AC2, and reconcile the result against the grep output.","cohort":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.9,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Fourth-review comment: 'Full inventory built on origin/main b97d414b8e2 ... with two greps, which AC2 now names verbatim.' Grep A matches removed verbs 'as string literals in any quoting' plus 'tag/exists/format as CLI argv'.","Implementation lane comment: 'test_schema_ticket_state.py[cli] and test_parity.py[cli] call the shared CLI adapter's .tag() (tests/interfaces/adapters.py:333 ran ‘rebar tag’), and test_format_symlink_tracker.py x3 called main(['format', ...]). AC2's quoted-literal grep missed all of them, because the verb sits in a helper or as the first element of a list.'","Live tree: tests/interfaces/adapters.py:332-333 defines `def tag(...)` -> `self._run(\"edit\", tid, f\"--add-tag={tag}\")` (post-fix); it dispatched the `tag` verb via a helper, invisible to a literal-`\"tag\"` grep. tests/interfaces/store/test_format_symlink_tracker.py:45,55,75,78 call `_format([\"resolve\", ...])` (post-fix), formerly `main([\"format\", ...])`."],"finding":"The removed-verb affected-site inventory is grep-derived (fourth-review comment: 'built ... with two greps'), and that method demonstrably omitted call sites where the verb is not a bare quoted literal. Two concrete omissions — the shared CLI adapter's `tag()` method (`rebar tag` through a helper) and `main(['format', ...])` with the verb as a list's first element — were missed by the plan's Grep A and only surfaced when the first `make verify` failed. Symbol-graph lookup (find_referencing_symbols plus a dispatch/argv-position scan), not a string-literal grep, is required to enumerate these.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3437855aa36e6552","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step (6) + AC2; inventory in the 2026-10-18 fourth-review comment ('Full inventory built ... with two greps')","norm_id":"n4763797f68f5db02","priority":0.0,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A removed verb invoked through an adapter/helper method (e.g. adapters.py `tag()` -> `_run(\"tag\", ...)`) is not matched by a literal-verb grep, so the test runs the removed verb and fails only at `make verify` — not during the planned AC2 grep check.","A removed verb passed as the first element of an argv list (`main([\"format\", id, ...])`) is not matched by Grep A's literal pattern, leaving the symlink round-trip tests driving a deleted route.","Any other helper-wrapped or argv-position use of a removed verb elsewhere in the tree would be omitted by the same method and silently under-deliver the retarget."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5","material_fingerprint":"f1261b278fbd8ccb","material_parts":{"children":["647ea2107ca5072f",0],"description":["4bef4b9d51c9f27f",7836],"description_boxes":["7668d2cd32a37eb4",11],"file_impact":["0aedc98ea3c11823",72],"ticket_id":["a20e8f9875421ba2",19]},"metr